# Praevis agent rules

Before changing code: read root `AGENTS.md`, `agent/STATUS.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, `docs/TASKS.md`, and relevant docs/tests.

After meaningful sessions: update `agent/STATUS.md`, `docs/TASKS.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md` (if needed), `agent/runs/`, and `agent/HANDOFF.md`.

Do not commit secrets, weaken SSRF/safety checks, execute scanned-page JavaScript, or add LLMs where deterministic rules suffice.

Codename `Praevis` is temporary — keep branding easy to replace.
